| CC  | Rs 70  | Rs 140 | Rs 210 | Rs 350  |
| EC  | Rs 160 | Rs 260 | Rs 390 | Rs 650  |
| 2S  | Rs 30  | Rs 60  | Rs 90  | Rs 150  |

